{"chunk_id": "d7fb552f-0e32-4d78-9068-d88b5a253286", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/elections/documents/Presidential Elections 1796 to 2016_final.pdf", "title": "Presidential Elections 1796 to 2016 final", "section_hierarchy": ["Elections", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 7, "chunk_total": 135, "word_count": 23, "text": "During the Revolutionary War, the 13 colonies established a new system: of government. The Articles of Confederation, formally known as the Articles of", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:23:45.417987+00:00"}
