{"chunk_id": "55772b82-8918-42fc-8809-17b48e92b8e7", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 34, "text": "In addition to the prohibited activities listed under #12(b), you cannot use cameras and electronic: advocates or attempt to exercise political influence while in the polling place. This is not the role of a", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191190+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "961846eb-0e56-4d9f-ac6d-4d9e791d636e", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 31, "text": "In addition to the prohibited activities listed under #12(b), you cannot use cameras and electronic: challenger or watcher, and if you do this, you will be removed from the polling place.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191196+00:00"}
