{"chunk_id": "635d9eac-82ea-4699-82ee-1621744ea4e3", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 5, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 32, "text": "In addition to the prohibited activities listed under #12(b), you cannot use cameras and electronic: place or wear anything with a political message. This includes buttons, shirts, hats, stickers, and the like.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191205+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "bfa22906-1a69-409b-af8e-6715c3c18634", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 6, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 30, "text": "2. On the ballot scanner, test ballots are scanned, and the results printed from the scanner: are compared with the expected number of votes for each candidate or ballot question.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191210+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "858414c0-41fa-4a8d-959c-1b7f1bd8002e", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 7, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 26, "text": "2. On the ballot scanner, test ballots are scanned, and the results printed from the scanner: This ensures that the ballot scanner is recording votes accurately.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191215+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "558cbb2e-56be-4473-8d8b-c8e9e5208662", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 8, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 30, "text": "2. On the ballot scanner, test ballots are scanned, and the results printed from the scanner: 3. These test votes are also counted by the central tabulating computer. This ensures", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191219+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "b2ddb4c6-8187-45ba-9f35-e19fb5194bdf", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 9, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 26, "text": "2. On the ballot scanner, test ballots are scanned, and the results printed from the scanner: complete accuracy throughout the entire voting and vote counting process.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191223+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "966efae4-e4ca-43cb-9937-1f98390ae43f", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 10, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 33, "text": "2. On the ballot scanner, test ballots are scanned, and the results printed from the scanner: 4. All test votes are cleared, and the ballot scanners are locked, sealed and secured ready to", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191228+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "d5a91db5-e90d-44f0-b7d1-99b7d621941d", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/Challenger_and_Watchers_Manual.pdf", "title": "Challenger and Watchers Manual", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 11, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 21, "text": "2. On the ballot scanner, test ballots are scanned, and the results printed from the scanner: be used in the election.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:24:09.191232+00:00"}
