{"chunk_id": "9d01e115-a920-4e95-a3c1-cecf35671f11", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/ft.pdf", "title": "ft", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 1, "word_count": 92, "text": "Sample Fund Raising Ticket\nNo. 4659 $25 per ticket No. 4659\nPlease complete all information on this\nCommittee to Elect Bob Smith\nticket stub.\nName: ________________________\nAnnual Bull Roast\nAddress: ______________________\n______________________________ Saturday June 4, 2004 • 2:00PM to 5:00PM\n•\nQuite Waters Park Annapolis, MD 22222\nAmount: _______ Cash Check\nEntertainment and lots of great food.\nMake Checks Payable to:\n$25.00\nCommittee to Elect Bob Smith\n222 North Street – Bowie, MD 22222\nCommittee to Elect Bob Smith Committee to Elect Bob Smith\nTerry Jones, Treasurer Terry Jones, Treasurer\nRevised 4/03", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:22.904223+00:00"}
