{"chunk_id": "e2c7a9fb-43e3-4f23-bf31-7e198275c664", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/coo.pdf", "title": "coo", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 5, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 40, "text": ": Residence Address:\n_________________________________________________________________\nNumber, Street, Apt. or Suite Number\n___________________________________________\nCity, State, and Zip Code | None: Mailing Address: (will be made available to the public)\n_________________________________________________________________\nNumber, Street, Apt. or Suite Number\n___________________________________________\nCity, State, and Zip Code", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:25.103570+00:00"}
