{"chunk_id": "0e669452-911f-4362-a5cf-246fd0692d8a", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/coo.pdf", "title": "coo", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 7, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 134, "text": ": I am a registered voter of: County: _______________________\nI accept the appointment of Chairman until the final Campaign Finance Report required by §13-311 of the Election Law Article is filed or until a successor is duly\nchosen and qualifies. I understand that I am required to follow the provisions of Title 13 of the Election Law Article, Annotated Code of Maryland with regard to the\nmanner in which this committee receives, spends, and reports money or valuable things to support/oppose state and local candidates or ballot issues. I understand that if I\nwish to resign, I must do so in writing, on the proper form, and file the resignation with the State Board of Elections.\n____________________________________________________________________________________________________\nSignature of new Chairman Date\nAcknowledgment of new appointment by Treasurer.\n____________________________________________________________________________________________________\nSignature of current Treasurer Date", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:25.103585+00:00"}
